      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Intramural gas collection in a bowel segment is an important roentgenological sign, consistent with necrosis of the bowel wall. This is demonstrated by an example of jejunal volvulus and an inflammatory conglomeration of intestine. The diagnostic interpretation must be completed by the clinical picture and other signs of intestinal ischemia."},
